    "Titles": {
        "eng": "The Villainess Is Adored by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom",
        "jpn": "悪役令嬢は隣国の王太子に溺愛される"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Tiararose was supposed to be disengaged and exiled from the country. \"This was the Otome game I had played!\" She realized on the day before the story’s ending――\r\n\r\nShall I wait for the judgment? But, I did not do anything too cruel... Thinking so, the ending continues. But, during the judgement――something that was not possible in the game happened. The neighboring crown prince courted the villainous daughter Tiararose.",
